    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9302" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοσία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> priv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fredom from
